1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:02:03,080 --> 00:02:07,290
I've been waiting for you.

25
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:08,730
Ye Wuyou
First generation Suzaku

26
00:02:08,760 --> 00:02:10,730
Ye Wuyou ?

27
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:13,810
What does Senior mean ?

28
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:17,650
Throughout generations, the successive Suzakus

29
00:02:17,840 --> 00:02:21,330
were always appointed by the previous Suzaku.

30
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:23,650
The only way to inherit the legacy

31
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:25,650
is to obtain the Suzaku Seal

32
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:28,210
and seize control of the Cultivation Planet Crystal.

33
00:02:29,560 --> 00:02:33,010
But if someone attempts to destroy the crystal,

34
00:02:33,320 --> 00:02:36,370
then it will choose its own master

35
00:02:36,840 --> 00:02:38,730
and make him the Suzaku.

36
00:02:39,240 --> 00:02:40,450
And you

37
00:02:40,480 --> 00:02:44,690
were chosen by the Cultivation Planet Crystal.

38
00:02:51,920 --> 00:02:55,010
Why does he have the aura of the Suzaku Seal ?

39
00:03:13,520 --> 00:03:14,530
That's...

40
00:03:14,480 --> 00:03:16,250
the Suzaku's inheritance !

41
00:03:16,760 --> 00:03:17,690
Impossible...

42
00:03:17,960 --> 00:03:19,050
Impossible !

43
00:03:19,200 --> 00:03:21,050
Without Zhuque Zi's approval,

44
00:03:20,880 --> 00:03:23,330
how could he obtain the Suzaku's inheritance ?

45
00:03:26,520 --> 00:03:28,970
Throughout 14 generations of Suzakus,

46
00:03:29,040 --> 00:03:32,450
this is the first time the crystal has been destroyed.

47
00:03:33,600 --> 00:03:35,290
So choosing him now

48
00:03:35,160 --> 00:03:36,890
makes a lot of sense.

49
00:03:37,240 --> 00:03:40,490
Are you willing to become the titled Suzaku ?

50
00:03:40,640 --> 00:03:43,130
Will you be planet Suzaku's guardian

51
00:03:42,920 --> 00:03:45,250
until the end of your lifespan ?

52
00:03:46,200 --> 00:03:47,450
I'm not willing.

53
00:03:53,640 --> 00:03:55,610
If you become the Suzaku,

54
00:03:55,840 --> 00:03:58,650
you will be the supreme ruler of planet Suzaku

55
00:03:58,440 --> 00:04:00,770
and worshipped by everyone.

56
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:03,170
The Heavenly Jade Sect
The Earth Soul Sect
The Immortal's Path Sect

57
00:04:02,920 --> 00:04:05,250
pays respect to the Suzaku.

58
00:04:05,520 --> 00:04:07,450
As Suzaku,

59
00:04:07,520 --> 00:04:10,370
countless treasures will be yours.

60
00:04:10,720 --> 00:04:14,650
There will be no obstacles in your cultivation.

61
00:04:15,200 --> 00:04:17,050
If you leave now,

62
00:04:17,040 --> 00:04:19,490
you will face countless dangers.

63
00:04:19,520 --> 00:04:23,050
One misstep can lead to certain death.

64
00:04:23,920 --> 00:04:27,050
If you stay and accept the Suzaku Seal,

65
00:04:27,240 --> 00:04:28,810
you will rule the planet

66
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:31,170
and live a carefree life.

67
00:04:31,320 --> 00:04:33,410
Why would you refuse ?

68
00:04:33,960 --> 00:04:35,370
My path

69
00:04:36,680 --> 00:04:39,850
won't stop at just planet Suzaku.

70
00:05:21,480 --> 00:05:22,850
Very well.

71
00:05:23,120 --> 00:05:24,610
To each their own,

72
00:05:24,920 --> 00:05:26,410
I can't force you.

73
00:05:26,280 --> 00:05:27,290
Senior,

74
00:05:27,280 --> 00:05:29,370
how do I retrieve my soul strand ?

75
00:05:29,320 --> 00:05:32,530
There are only two methods.

76
00:05:32,520 --> 00:05:36,210
The first is to kill the spirit that holds your soul strand.

77
00:05:36,120 --> 00:05:38,850
But finding your soul strand

78
00:05:38,600 --> 00:05:40,850
among all those spirits

79
00:05:40,640 --> 00:05:42,290
is unlikely

80
00:05:42,040 --> 00:05:43,810
and cannot be forced.

81
00:05:44,200 --> 00:05:45,810
The second method

82
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:46,970
is to trade

83
00:05:47,200 --> 00:05:49,890
a life for a life.

84
00:05:51,160 --> 00:05:52,530
You can go.

85
00:05:57,960 --> 00:06:01,210
He actually rejected the Suzaku's inheritance ?

86
00:06:01,600 --> 00:06:04,570
A life for a life ?

87
00:06:05,320 --> 00:06:08,010
These two are my mortal enemies,

88
00:06:08,160 --> 00:06:11,570
they're perfect to exchange for my soul strand.

89
00:06:12,080 --> 00:06:15,810
But direct disciples of the Suzaku will be hard to kill.

90
00:06:15,960 --> 00:06:18,130
I should make a distraction first

91
00:06:18,360 --> 00:06:20,330
to weaken them.

92
00:06:20,520 --> 00:06:23,010
The Cultivation Planet Crystal doesn't have a master.

93
00:06:22,760 --> 00:06:24,130
Whoever obtains it

94
00:06:24,560 --> 00:06:27,890
will rule planet Suzaku.

95
00:06:28,800 --> 00:06:29,890
The Cultivation Planet Crystal !?

96
00:06:29,640 --> 00:06:30,930
Rule planet Suzaku !?

97
00:06:30,680 --> 00:06:32,210
This is a tremendous opportunity !

98
00:06:31,960 --> 00:06:32,850
It's mine !

99
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:35,090
It must be mine !

100
00:06:34,840 --> 00:06:36,530
Don't you dare compete with me !

101
00:06:37,320 --> 00:06:39,010
Suzaku Formation,

102
00:06:38,960 --> 00:06:40,090
activate !

103
00:06:40,160 --> 00:06:41,970
The Cultivation Planet Crystal

104
00:06:41,960 --> 00:06:43,730
belongs to me !

105
00:06:43,560 --> 00:06:45,050
Give it to me !

106
00:07:10,240 --> 00:07:11,850
Is he being possessed ?

107
00:07:18,840 --> 00:07:20,610
Zhuque Zi...

108
00:07:20,800 --> 00:07:22,290
Junior Brother,

109
00:07:22,360 --> 00:07:26,970
this game was getting interesting

110
00:07:27,120 --> 00:07:31,010
so I borrowed Qian Feng's lifespan to come here

111
00:07:30,880 --> 00:07:34,570
and properly reunite with you.

112
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:37,130
Did you think that

113
00:07:37,120 --> 00:07:41,770
I would give up planet Suzaku so easily ?

114
00:07:42,120 --> 00:07:44,970
You possessed and consumed your disciple's lifespan

115
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:47,170
in order to replenish your own.

116
00:07:47,240 --> 00:07:49,770
Senior Brother's methods are impressive.

117
00:07:51,200 --> 00:07:52,250
Zhuque Zi !

118
00:07:52,400 --> 00:07:53,410
This is bad !

119
00:07:53,320 --> 00:07:54,410
Retreat !

120
00:07:56,520 --> 00:07:59,410
This doll is made from celestial iron.

121
00:07:59,520 --> 00:08:02,210
When you're in danger, activate its mechanism

122
00:08:02,320 --> 00:08:05,050
and it will save your life.

123
00:08:05,440 --> 00:08:07,890
If I had used it during a battle,

124
00:08:07,840 --> 00:08:09,330
it would have killed me

125
00:08:09,320 --> 00:08:10,970
before I killed anyone !

126
00:08:12,560 --> 00:08:14,530
The time has come

127
00:08:14,800 --> 00:08:16,650
to retrieve my soul strand.

128
00:08:16,960 --> 00:08:19,530
That doll is made of celestial iron

129
00:08:19,280 --> 00:08:21,650
and required centuries to refine.

130
00:08:23,120 --> 00:08:24,410
Could it be that...

131
00:08:24,400 --> 00:08:26,450
Zhuque Zi nurtured me from childhood

132
00:08:26,440 --> 00:08:28,570
just to steal my body !?

133
00:08:28,640 --> 00:08:30,690
That old bastard !

134
00:08:32,800 --> 00:08:34,650
You're dead !

135
00:08:52,440 --> 00:08:53,890
Transform !

136
00:08:59,680 --> 00:09:02,410
The direct disciple of the Suzaku

137
00:09:02,760 --> 00:09:04,410
is really hard to kill.

138
00:09:23,080 --> 00:09:24,130
Seal !

139
00:09:27,400 --> 00:09:28,490
Ceng Niu !

140
00:09:28,400 --> 00:09:30,570
Why are you trying to kill me !?

141
00:09:30,320 --> 00:09:31,890
I'm killing you

142
00:09:31,960 --> 00:09:33,610
for my own sake

143
00:09:33,800 --> 00:09:35,930
and because I promised Red Butterfly.

144
00:09:40,120 --> 00:09:42,210
This is the end for you,

145
00:09:42,320 --> 00:09:44,050
accept your death.

146
00:09:46,800 --> 00:09:48,850
Have you forgotten

147
00:09:49,440 --> 00:09:51,850
the Ancient God Blood Sword ?

148
00:09:53,520 --> 00:09:56,210
Ancient God Blood Sword

149
00:10:03,080 --> 00:10:04,290
This is...

150
00:10:06,960 --> 00:10:08,570
Ancient God blood ?

151
00:10:08,480 --> 00:10:10,890
My Qian Family's ancestors once said...

152
00:10:10,960 --> 00:10:14,050
that this sword can only be unsheathed if the family is in danger.

153
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:15,010
Ceng Niu...

154
00:10:15,120 --> 00:10:16,730
Since it has come to this,

155
00:10:16,760 --> 00:10:18,610
you can rest in peace now !

156
00:10:19,040 --> 00:10:20,530
Die !

157
00:10:20,280 --> 00:10:22,090
The blood on this sword

158
00:10:21,840 --> 00:10:24,210
is the true blood of a 9-star Ancient God !

159
00:10:24,800 --> 00:10:27,250
How could Qian Feng have this as his last resort ?

160
00:10:27,560 --> 00:10:28,890
Killing him

161
00:10:28,880 --> 00:10:30,650
will not be easy.

162
00:10:43,400 --> 00:10:44,410
Tuo Sen !

163
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:45,770
What is this monster ?

164
00:10:45,760 --> 00:10:47,010
Die !

165
00:10:49,840 --> 00:10:52,420
So the puppet was just a decoy

166
00:10:52,360 --> 00:10:54,810
and his Divine Sense was in the monkey.

167
00:10:57,960 --> 00:11:01,330
I didn’t want to resort to using this method

168
00:11:01,160 --> 00:11:05,130
because it will slightly damage my Divine Sense.

169
00:11:05,520 --> 00:11:07,570
But that puppet

170
00:11:07,320 --> 00:11:09,450
was utterly worthless.

171
00:11:09,400 --> 00:11:12,730
But now, with a drop of Ancient God blood,

172
00:11:13,640 --> 00:11:17,130
the Cultivation Planet Crystal is mine !

173
00:11:17,080 --> 00:11:18,770
After thousands of years...

174
00:11:18,800 --> 00:11:20,170
I will

175
00:11:20,320 --> 00:11:23,730
finally break free !

176
00:11:30,520 --> 00:11:32,690
Little brat,

177
00:11:32,640 --> 00:11:34,850
wait until I obtain the Cultivation Planet Crystal

178
00:11:34,920 --> 00:11:37,850
and then I'll come to deal with you.

179
00:11:46,600 --> 00:11:48,530
If Tuo Sen is back,

180
00:11:49,040 --> 00:11:50,810
then I can’t stay here.

181
00:11:54,280 --> 00:11:56,290
I use Qian Feng’s life

182
00:11:56,280 --> 00:11:58,770
to reclaim my soul strand !

183
00:11:59,480 --> 00:12:00,450
Red

184
00:12:00,200 --> 00:12:01,250
Butterfly...

185
00:12:14,720 --> 00:12:15,770
Trade !

186
00:12:33,480 --> 00:12:35,690
Qian Feng, oh Qian Feng...

187
00:12:35,720 --> 00:12:38,050
When you used me as your cultivation furnace

188
00:12:38,520 --> 00:12:40,610
did you ever imagine this day ?

189
00:12:44,520 --> 00:12:45,490
Reverse !

190
00:12:54,360 --> 00:12:55,490
Brother Wang...

191
00:12:55,920 --> 00:12:59,370
Senior Yunque taught her the furnace reversal technique.

192
00:12:59,760 --> 00:13:01,610
By killing Qian Feng,

193
00:13:01,840 --> 00:13:03,570
you gave Zi Xin

194
00:13:03,880 --> 00:13:06,290
his Soul Transformation cultivation.

195
00:13:13,240 --> 00:13:15,850
The Suzaku Tomb's collapse is so bad that

196
00:13:15,920 --> 00:13:18,650
even Situ Nan’s teleportation jade slip is struggling to activate.

197
00:13:39,240 --> 00:13:40,570
Wang Lin...

198
00:13:41,240 --> 00:13:43,690
Now it’s your turn.

199
00:13:58,920 --> 00:14:00,970
You do have some skill.

200
00:14:01,560 --> 00:14:04,610
It's no wonder that a mere Core Formation brat

201
00:14:04,560 --> 00:14:07,570
was able to obtain the memory inheritance.

202
00:14:08,240 --> 00:14:09,290
Merge !

203
00:14:10,320 --> 00:14:11,970
It's a pity that

204
00:14:12,200 --> 00:14:14,330
you can’t stop me.

205
00:14:40,760 --> 00:14:43,410
Come back here.

206
00:14:58,320 --> 00:14:59,610
Come out !

207
00:15:11,120 --> 00:15:12,250
Explode !

208
00:15:29,360 --> 00:15:30,090
What

209
00:15:29,840 --> 00:15:31,090
is happening ?

210
00:15:36,720 --> 00:15:38,570
If I make it out alive,

211
00:15:39,560 --> 00:15:42,050
I need to refill the Soul Flag.

212
00:15:50,040 --> 00:15:53,490
Even Zhuque Zi and I weren't able to stop him.

213
00:15:53,840 --> 00:15:57,090
But Wang Lin somehow killed him alone.

214
00:15:57,120 --> 00:15:58,810
The Cultivation Planet Crystal...

215
00:15:58,720 --> 00:16:00,610
Where is the Cultivation Planet Crystal !?

216
00:16:00,360 --> 00:16:03,610
To think that you could do this...

217
00:16:03,920 --> 00:16:05,490
Wang Lin...

218
00:16:05,560 --> 00:16:08,210
I really underestimated you.

219
00:16:13,560 --> 00:16:17,130
The self-detonation of all the souls in the Billion-Soul Flag

220
00:16:16,880 --> 00:16:19,690
wasn't enough to destroy a sliver of his Divine Sense.

221
00:16:34,080 --> 00:16:36,170
Die !

222
00:16:39,440 --> 00:16:41,890
I don't think that the Heaven Defying Bead

223
00:16:41,760 --> 00:16:43,930
can even help me escape from Tuo Sen.

224
00:16:44,440 --> 00:16:45,690
Seal.

225
00:16:53,000 --> 00:16:54,770
This farce

226
00:16:54,800 --> 00:16:57,450
ends here.

227
00:16:57,880 --> 00:16:59,810
Who are you ?

228
00:17:06,840 --> 00:17:09,170
It doesn't even matter who you are.

229
00:17:09,320 --> 00:17:11,090
Once I break free,

230
00:17:11,360 --> 00:17:13,610
I will kill you !

231
00:17:44,560 --> 00:17:45,690
You...

232
00:17:45,440 --> 00:17:46,890
You are...

233
00:17:47,720 --> 00:17:49,290
Zhuque Zi,

234
00:17:49,680 --> 00:17:52,050
will you admit your mistake ?

235
00:17:52,840 --> 00:17:54,410
Junior was wrong.

236
00:17:54,520 --> 00:17:56,810
I beg Lord Envoy for forgiveness.

237
00:17:57,040 --> 00:17:58,770
Envoy ?

238
00:17:58,960 --> 00:18:01,370
The Envoy of the Cultivation Alliance !

239
00:18:01,560 --> 00:18:03,050
Zhuque Zi,

240
00:18:03,080 --> 00:18:06,090
you dared to destroy the Cultivation Planet Crystal

241
00:18:06,240 --> 00:18:08,370
which is unforgivable.

242
00:18:09,080 --> 00:18:11,290
But given the circumstances,

243
00:18:11,400 --> 00:18:14,130
the Cultivation Alliance will let it slide.

244
00:18:14,240 --> 00:18:17,130
You can leave now.

245
00:18:30,080 --> 00:18:31,370
Junior Brother...

246
00:18:32,600 --> 00:18:34,330
In the end,

247
00:18:34,800 --> 00:18:36,410
you still

248
00:18:36,560 --> 00:18:38,970
weren't able to defeat me.

249
00:18:38,840 --> 00:18:40,410
I...

250
00:18:47,680 --> 00:18:49,130
Senior Brother...

251
00:18:49,560 --> 00:18:51,570
None of us won.

252
00:18:52,520 --> 00:18:55,690
We both lost miserably.

253
00:18:59,960 --> 00:19:01,330
This person

254
00:19:01,920 --> 00:19:03,970
feels strangely familiar.

255
00:19:06,600 --> 00:19:07,690
So...

256
00:19:07,720 --> 00:19:09,410
Does Brother Ceng Niu

257
00:19:09,360 --> 00:19:11,330
not recognize me ?

258
00:19:13,000 --> 00:19:14,730
It's you !

259
00:19:18,050 --> 00:21:54,500
Even if it looks like the Billion-Soul Flag exploded here, it didn't. Wang Lin even mentions the need to refill it later.
What happened in the novel is that Wang Lin took out all of the souls inside the flag to make them self destruct in hope of killing Tuo Sen's Divine Sense but he was also fighting with Zi Xin at the same time with a few primary souls. Those souls survived and returned to the Billion-Soul Flag after the fight.

260
00:19:35,210 --> 00:19:38,760
To let go of the consequences of my actions

261
00:19:38,510 --> 00:19:40,480
is to ignore the law of cause and effect

262
00:19:40,270 --> 00:19:42,420
like scattered ink.

263
00:19:43,050 --> 00:19:49,900
As destiny falls

264
00:19:45,890 --> 00:19:49,900
in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.

265
00:19:49,650 --> 00:19:57,500
It makes the mountains lose their colors,

266
00:19:52,890 --> 00:19:57,500
wither and melt into rivers.

267
00:19:57,690 --> 00:20:05,060
Who can deceive

268
00:20:00,450 --> 00:20:05,060
the law of the heavens ?

269
00:20:05,130 --> 00:20:08,380
Countless generations

270
00:20:06,410 --> 00:20:08,380
have tried before me.

271
00:20:08,420 --> 00:20:12,100
But how could I not catch my dreams

272
00:20:10,250 --> 00:20:12,100
within my warm fingers ?

273
00:20:12,410 --> 00:20:16,180
You're at my side when I'm alone

274
00:20:15,930 --> 00:20:19,500
giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.

275
00:20:20,010 --> 00:20:23,460
Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.

276
00:20:23,570 --> 00:20:27,660
I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks

277
00:20:25,410 --> 00:20:27,660
in the streets.

278
00:20:27,570 --> 00:20:32,620
Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?

279
00:20:29,130 --> 00:20:32,620
Can I break the rules ?

280
00:20:32,380 --> 00:20:35,340
To run towards you !

281
00:20:35,130 --> 00:20:38,660
I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect

282
00:20:38,410 --> 00:20:43,300
to cut down this tribulation with my own hands

283
00:20:43,050 --> 00:20:46,700
and break through the reincarnation cycle.

284
00:20:46,490 --> 00:20:51,380
All of that for the stars in your eyes.

285
00:20:51,580 --> 00:20:57,060
I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.

286
00:20:56,930 --> 00:21:00,980
If your soul is willing to wander,

287
00:21:00,730 --> 00:21:05,620
can I still take your hands

288
00:21:02,410 --> 00:21:05,620
and hold them tight ?

289
00:21:05,530 --> 00:21:08,700
I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.

290
00:21:08,450 --> 00:21:13,580
I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.

291
00:21:13,340 --> 00:21:16,860
I dream of destroying

292
00:21:16,770 --> 00:21:21,580
the shackles of our fate.

293
00:21:21,330 --> 00:21:25,540
You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.

294
00:21:25,290 --> 00:21:28,340
You're the hardest to let go of.

295
00:21:28,170 --> 00:21:32,220
I want to be with you again

296
00:21:32,050 --> 00:21:35,580
so I can look in your eyes.

297
00:21:35,610 --> 00:21:40,820
Even for a moment, it's worth it.
